  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary low-top Nike Dunk silhouette\nLeather upper with patent leather overlays for a luxe aesthetic\nPerforated toe box increases ventilation\nPadded tongue and a low-top collar with signature Nike branding\nSwooshes at lateral and medial sides with embroidered NIKE heel detail adds a signature touch\nFoam midsole offers lightweight, responsive cushioning\nRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle enhances durability and reliable traction across surfaces\nClassic lace-up closure secures the fit\nThe Nike Dunk Low Patent Leather is imported.\nClass up your collection of sneakers with the glossy Women's Nike Dunk Low Patent Leather Casual Shoes. This exclusive edition of the Dunk is crafted with leather uppers and patent leather overlays, featuring a high-contrast, color-blocked palette while incorporating all of the classic design elements you cherish most about this iconic Swoosh silhouette.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low Patent Leather Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Pink Foam/Black/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3337873</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padd